We sit down at the beautiful table.
Eva has set the table with colorful plates and lit candles.
She serves a lovely vegetarian meal for us.
"Thank you, Eva, it looks delicious," I say with a smile.
"It smells absolutely fantastic."
"You are welcome," she answers and hands me a bowl of salad.
I immediately taste the food.
I think that the fresh ingredients really taste wonderful.
"This is incredibly delicious," I tell her.
"I intend to cook even more local dishes soon," I say.
"I would very much like to use more Danish vegetables."
"That sounds like a really good idea," Eva says happily.
"We shall definitely cook together one day."
"I believe that we will probably have fun in the kitchen."
"I would very much like that," I answer and take another bite.
We pour some cold water into the glasses.
I feel that the evening already is a great success.
